nt_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-jin035-pei-yan-kai","subject_person_id":"svy_zgs_3by","predicate":"agnatic_cousin","object_person_id":"530_f9d_4bd","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","source_id":"s-jinshu-035-peikai-ws2506399","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p004","quote":"楷性寬厚，與物無忤。不持儉素，每游榮貴，輒取其珍玩。雖車馬器服，宿昔之間，便以施諸窮乏。嘗營別宅，其從兄衍見而悅之，即以宅與衍。梁、趙二王，國之近屬，貴重當時，楷歲請二國租錢百萬，以散親族。人或譏之，楷曰：「損有餘以補不足，天之道也。」安於毀譽，其行己任率，皆此類也。與山濤、和嶠並以盛德居位，帝嘗問曰：「朕應天順時，海內更始，天下風聲，何得何失？」楷對曰：「陛下受命，四海承風，所以未比德於堯舜者，但以賈充之徒尚在朝耳。方宜引天下賢人，與弘正道，不宜示人以私。」時任愷、庾純亦以充為言，帝乃出充為關中都督。充納女于太子，乃止。平吳之後，帝方修太平之化，每延公卿，與論政道。楷陳三五之風，次敘漢魏盛衰之跡。帝稱善，坐者嘆服焉。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p004:m0052","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p004:m0000"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"從兄","source_clause_binding":{"kind":"biography_family_clause","rule":"home_owner_agnatic_elder_cousin","roles":{"owner":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p004:m0000","cousin":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p004:m0052"},"clause_start":44,"clause_end":62,"paragraph_sha256":"25302d7a19fdf546b976aa8106ed634fc6df159c505421c535e8584cb459ac1e","revision_id":2506399},"relative_birth_order":{"older_person_id":"svy_zgs_3by","younger_person_id":"530_f9d_4bd","operator":"lt","older_ordinal":null,"younger_ordinal":null,"scope":"agnatic_cousins"},"kinship_structure":{"lineage":"paternal","generation_difference":0,"collateral":true,"distance":null,"common_ancestor_person_id":null,"subject_relative_age":"older"}},"interpretation_note":"只記完整原文所述及限定的上下文指涉；不由婚配、排行或宗祧承繼推未載生母、父系世距或法律收養。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}